@startuml useCase9Notification

hide footbox

participant "Buyer/Client" as B
participant "Seller/Server" as S

B -> S: POST {{baseUrl}}/hub with {{callbackUrl}} details
S --> B: 201 Subscribed with {{id}}
...
B -> S: POST {{baseUrl}}/modifyPerformanceJob (ModifyPerformanceJob_Create)
S -> S: basic validation

alt succesful inquiry
S --> B: 201 ModifyPerformanceJob with {{id}}, `acknowledged` state 
...

S -> S: process ModifyPerformanceJob

S -> B: {{callbackUrl}}/listener/modifyPerformanceJobStateChangeEvent ({{id}})
B --> S: 204 confirmation
B -> S:   GET {{baseUrl}}/modifyPerformanceJob/{{id}}
return 200 ModifyPerformanceJob in current state

else validation or internal problem
  S --> B : 4xx or 5xx error response
end 

...

B -> S : DELETE {{baseUrl}}/hub/{{id}} 
S --> B : 204 Deleted

@enduml